From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:00:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Arnold and Affton location page patterns

Registers data-driven location/service area page patterns generated from
firstchoice_location_data(), so a new city is one array entry. Arnold
includes its extra storm damage section; Affton uses the standard flow.

Styling follows the Figma reference and reuses existing theme treatments
(.big-red-box for the CTA, .testimonials-section for the review block).

Also div-qualifies the flex column widths for the warranty/insurance and
services sections, since the blanket div:not(.alignwide):not(.alignfull)
width:100% rule outranks single-class selectors and collapsed them.

SEO metadata and per-page build steps documented in LOCATION-PAGES.md.
